  "docs": {
    "trivia": "Whitespace trivia.",
    "main": "A guard that inspects the RAW byte after \"a\": trivia is not injected\ninside a lookahead, so a space there must fail even though the skip\nrule would otherwise consume it."
  },
  "source": "## Semantics: C5, S1, S4, S5, S6, T1, M0, A1\ngrammar ConformanceSkipLookahead version \"1.0.0\" mode \"v1\" {\n  ## Whitespace trivia.\n  trivia = 1*\" \"\n  ## A guard that inspects the RAW byte after \"a\": trivia is not injected\n  ## inside a lookahead, so a space there must fail even though the skip\n  ## rule would otherwise consume it.\n  main = \"a\" !\" \" \"c\"\n\n  skip = trivia\n\n  entry main: main\n\n  test main {\n    accept \"ac\"\n    accept \"ac   \"\n    reject \"a c\"\n    reject \"a  c\"\n  }\n}\n",
